{"files": [{"id": 25569117, "name": "12915_2020_905_MOESM1_ESM.pdf", "size": 987179, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/25569117", "supplied_md5": "03cceed406c4dca3fc7b0044999a7041", "computed_md5": "03cceed406c4dca3fc7b0044999a7041", "mimetype": "application/pdf"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 9676479, "full_name": "Luisa Henkel", "first_name": "Luisa", "last_name": "Henkel", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9676482, "full_name": "Benedikt Rauscher", "first_name": "Benedikt", "last_name": "Rauscher", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 476884, "full_name": "Barbara Schmitt", "first_name": "Barbara", "last_name": "Schmitt", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 3446093, "full_name": "Jan Winter", "first_name": "Jan", "last_name": "Winter", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9676485, "full_name": "Michael Boutros", "first_name": "Michael", "last_name": "Boutros", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": "0000-0002-9458-817X"}], "custom_fields": [{"name": "Research Data Support", "value": "", "settings": {"validations": {"min_length": 1, "max_length": 250}, "placeholder": "Complete where RDS data are part of RDS submission"}, "field_type": "text", "order": null, "is_mandatory": false}], "figshare_url": "https://springernature.figshare.com/articles/journal_contribution/Additional_file_1_of_Genome-scale_CRISPR_screening_at_high_sensitivity_with_an_empirically_designed_sgRNA_library/13278609", "download_disabled": false, "description": "Additional file 1: Figure S1. HD CRISPR library composition. (A) Precision recall curves for differentiating reference core and nonessential genes based on BAGEL Bayes Factors determined for published fitness screens in GenomeCRISPR. Blue curves indicate screens with an area under the curve (AUC) greater than 0.9. Red screens with an AUC of less than 0.9 were excluded for HD CRISPR sgRNA design. (B) Log2 fold change distributions of core essential (red) and nonessential (blue) reference genes for a high quality (left) and a low quality (right) example screen. (C) Library composition of the HD CRISPR sub-libraries A and B. Horizontal bars on the left indicate the number of designs used from different previously published libraries. The panel on the bottom right shows combinations of libraries, that include designs selected for the HD CRISPR library. The bars above this panel quantify the number of selected sgRNAs for each of these combinations. (D) Distribution of exon ranks targeted by the sgRNAs in the HD CRISPR library. (E) Distribution of the predicted off-target counts (see Materials & Methods) for sgRNAs in the HD CRISPR library. (F) Number of sgRNAs, which remained per gene after pre-filtering and were considered for library design. (G) Phenotypic deviation of published sgRNA phenotypes targeting the same gene. For each gene the difference between the GenomeCRISPR effect scores of the sgRNAs with the smallest and the largest effect scores was calculated. This process was repeated for each library using only those sgRNAs included in that library. Guides selected for the HD CRISPR libraries A and B show a narrow phenotypic deviation in published screens from which they were selected.", "funding": "de.NBi BMBF", "funding_list": [{"id": 19470519, "title": "de.NBi BMBF", "grant_code": "", "funder_name": null, "is_user_defined": 1}], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 987179, "created_date": "2020-11-24T04:55:33Z", "modified_date": "2026-03-08T09:19:25Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 47, "name": "CC BY + CC0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["CRISPR/Cas9", "Genetic screens", "sgRNA design", "Gene essentiality", "Functional genomics"], "keywords": ["CRISPR/Cas9", "Genetic screens",